OL,3,AUK warned over ballooning debt costs
OL,4,Aand slower growth ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo influential economic bodies have
OL,7,Fwarned the UK's ballooning debt costs
OL,8,Fand slower economic growth put the
OL,9,Fcountry in a tougher position ahead of
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey's first Budget
OL,11,Fnext month.
OL,13,FThe UK is one of several countries
OL,14,Ffacing downgraded growth forecasts in a
OL,15,Freport by the influential Organisation
OL,16,Fof Economic Co-operation and
OL,17,FDevelopment (OECD) on Wednesday.
OL,19,FThe head of the International Monetary
OL,20,FFund (IMF) also told the BBC that
OL,21,FBritain and the US needed "the courage"
OL,22,Fto take action on debt.
