OL,3,AUK warned over ballooning debt costs
OL,4,Aand slower growth ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising borrowing costs are limiting
OL,7,Fgovernments' room for maneouvre as
OL,8,Fpressure grows for more spending on
OL,9,Fdefence and support for people facing
OL,10,Fprice rises.
